So, how exactly did you know my father?


00:39:49.240 --> 00:39:51.310
No. No.


00:39:53.040 --> 00:39:56.112
You think you can come in here
and just slander my dad's name


00:39:56.240 --> 00:39:59.437
by showing me a couple of pictures
of you guys going to see <i>Dreamgirls?</i>


00:39:59.560 --> 00:40:01.835
So what? I've seen <i>Dreamgirls</i>
two, three times.


00:40:01.960 --> 00:40:03.279
Doesn't mean I'm gay.


00:40:03.400 --> 00:40:07.473
<i>Steppin' to the bad side</i>
<i>Gonna be a mean ride</i>


00:40:07.600 --> 00:40:09.511
- What's that prove?
- I'm sorry.


00:40:09.640 --> 00:40:14.111
I guess he would've told you himself,
but he wasn't sure how you'd react.


00:40:14.240 --> 00:40:15.559
Does my mother know?


00:40:15.680 --> 00:40:18.240
No. And there's no reason she has to.


00:40:18.360 --> 00:40:21.113
Just as long as I get what's owed to me.


00:40:21.240 --> 00:40:24.949
Excuse me? What's owed to you?


00:40:25.080 --> 00:40:27.036
Well, I deserve something.


00:40:27.160 --> 00:40:30.596
Your father and I were lovers
and he left me absolutely nothing in his will.


00:40:30.720 --> 00:40:32.358
How do you think that makes me feel?


00:40:32.480 --> 00:40:34.994
I don't know and I don't care.


00:40:35.120 --> 00:40:38.271
I will tell you how it makes me feel. Cheap.


00:40:40.200 --> 00:40:43.078
- Like some cheap piece of ass.
- What do you want?


00:40:43.200 --> 00:40:46.556
What I want is a lot,
but I'm not asking you for what I want.


00:40:46.680 --> 00:40:50.195
- I deserve $30,000.
- $30,000?


00:40:50.320 --> 00:40:53.995
Are you smoking meth?
I'm not giving you $30,000.


00:40:54.480 --> 00:40:56.232
I'm trying to buy a house!
I'm trying to have a kid!


00:40:56.360 --> 00:40:57.679
