Can you do that?


00:42:39.120 --> 00:42:40.269
For me?


00:42:41.760 --> 00:42:43.910
All right. Yeah.


00:42:44.040 --> 00:42:47.828
Yeah, that's what I'm talking about.
And I got all kind of snacks for you.


00:42:48.000 --> 00:42:49.797
- Really?
- You like Sugar Daddies?


00:42:49.920 --> 00:42:51.558
- Ryan, Ryan, I need to talk to you.
- Gummi bears...


00:42:51.680 --> 00:42:53.193
- Ryan, I need to talk...
- Aaron, not now.


00:42:53.320 --> 00:42:56.471
- I really need to talk to you.
- Aaron, give me five minutes, okay?


00:42:56.600 --> 00:42:58.192
Bro, I'm grieving here.


00:42:58.320 --> 00:43:00.880
Martina, could you excuse us?
We've really got to talk about something.


00:43:01.000 --> 00:43:03.833
Hey, <i>SpongeBob</i> is on.
All right, talk to you later.


00:43:03.960 --> 00:43:05.632
What are you doing?


00:43:06.800 --> 00:43:10.236
Remember the guy that came by
a little earlier, that we didn't recognise?


00:43:10.360 --> 00:43:13.875
- Dude in the leather jacket.
- Yeah, well,


00:43:14.000 --> 00:43:17.595
he came by the study, and he showed me
some pictures of him and Dad.


00:43:17.720 --> 00:43:19.073
So? So, he showed you some pictures,


00:43:19.200 --> 00:43:23.478
- what's wrong with that?
- Pictures of him and Dad together.


00:43:23.960 --> 00:43:28.351
- So, we playing 20 questions now or what?
- He was Dad's lover.


00:43:28.480 --> 00:43:32.712
- No, man. No, no, no, no.
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, the guy's name is Frank.


00:43:32.840 --> 00:43:36.230
He showed me some pictures
of him and Dad doing stuff.


00:43:37.520 --> 00:43:40.080
You telling me our father was
on the downlow?


00:43:40.200 --> 00:43:42.714
- Way down low.
- Hell no.


00:43:42.840 --> 00:43:45.434
I don't believe that. My father's not gay.


00:43:45.560 --> 00:43:48.358
Matter of fact, he's so straight,
he makes me seem gay.


00:43:48.480 --> 00:43:50.391
And I ain't fucking gay.


00:43:52.480 --> 00:43:53.595
Daddy!


00:43:55.200 --> 00:43:56.997
I ain't know he did yoga.


00:43:57.120 --> 00:43:59.270
Look. He got the wheelbarrow.


00:43:59.400 --> 00:43:59.440
- Thanks.
- I just don't get it.


00:43:59.440 --> 00:44:01.635
- Thanks.
- I just don't get it.


00:44:01.760 --> 00:44:04.832
I don't know what she sees in that poser
that she doesn't see in me.


00:44:05.000 --> 00:44:07.719
